WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.360
<v Speaker 1>Pro Tour Honolulu 2006 here with Craig Jones. How you doing, Craig?</v>

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:07.250
<v Speaker 2>Yeah, pretty good. It's top 8 and no self destructions this time.</v>

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:10.080
<v Speaker 1>When in fact you need have to sweat it out. You were qualified 2 hours ago.</v>

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Speaker 2>Yeah, pretty much sat around,</v>

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:15.120
<v Speaker 2>you've got draws, just skip to some people and.</v>

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:15.950
<v Speaker 1>What do you playing?</v>

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:31.510
<v Speaker 2>A zoo. Wow. I say zoo. It's red deck, really. It's got burning small creatures. But I'm quite good against the control matchups. I mean, it's kind of strange that be coming into the tournament we thought that Raff and Face Fetters and Locks and Hierarchy would mean that the aggro decks just wouldn't stand a chance.</v>

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.150
<v Speaker 1>So is your worst match at the mirror?</v>

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:41.610
<v Speaker 2>The mayor is pretty random. It's a bit of a coin flip I think. Like the black white aggro matches can be quite bad if they get a Kitty early. I don't really fear a lot of matchups now.</v>

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:45.910
<v Speaker 1>I'm sure well a lot of people will be rooting for you. Got a good story and everybody likes Sudek so good looking copy.</v>

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:46.920
<v Speaker 2>Thanks. Thanks A.</v>

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:47.100
<v Speaker 1>Lot.</v>

